<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Rubbermaid raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Rubbermaid raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Scott Graham upgraded Rubbermaid Inc to outperform from market perform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- shares jumped 7/8 to 25-1/2.</p>
